com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.webm?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.mp4?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Pick up items that can be used later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/ad73b46788a941562f212d658b94c16f.poster.avif?t=1773674142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/ad73b46788a941562f212d658b94c16f.webm?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/ad73b46788a941562f212d658b94c16f.mp4?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/9f824f3684e2b46805ecf76763cea1a1.poster.avif?t=1773674142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/9f824f3684e2b46805ecf76763cea1a1.webm?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/9f824f3684e2b46805ecf76763cea1a1.mp4?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/c20630d0df09fd6ddc16e131c91a789b.poster.avif?t=1773674142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/c20630d0df09fd6ddc16e131c91a789b.webm?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/c20630d0df09fd6ddc16e131c91a789b.mp4?t=1773674142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging narrative that invites you to explore and understand the world's secrets and history, including discovering lore by collecting pages of drawings in a journal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore atmospheric locations</strong> brought to life with immersive environmental sound and detailed scenery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe your surroundings carefully</strong> \u2014 subtle cursor animations reveal hidden objects and interactive elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact through hand-drawn sketches</strong> that visually show the actions your character can perform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and use objects</strong> to trigger events and uncover new paths forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine certain items in your inventory</strong> to unlock new interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigger cinematic sequences</strong> that reveal the story and open new areas to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel between locations</strong> using a fast-travel map once areas are discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect illustrated sketchbook pages</strong> that gradually reveal the world\u2019s history.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Eye of the Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301420/8dde305c3b274e3eb97abe897347c6f80e6160c5.jpg"},{"name":"Back Home, Puppy","path":"https://cdn.